Description: music production studio in the style of Logic Pro
 Pro Wave is a digital audio workstation written in Rust: tracks,
 regions, a piano roll, a mixer and a built-in synthesizer, with audio
 through ALSA (PipeWire and PulseAudio via their ALSA plug-ins).
 .
 This is an early development build; many features are still missing.
